What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/flipper-one-fw-update/<dev>/firmware_version
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.5
Contact:	Alexey Charkov <alchark@flipper.net>
Description:	(RO) Version of the firmware the Flipper One MCU is running,
		as major.minor.patch. MCU firmware that predates updates over
		I2C, or an image without version information, reads as 0.0.0.

		A newly uploaded image only runs once the MCU restarts, so
		this keeps reporting the old version until then.

		Images themselves are uploaded through the firmware upload
		class as /sys/class/firmware/flipper-one-mcu/, see
		sysfs-class-firmware. Both UF2 files and raw binary images
		are accepted.

		Format: %u.%u.%u.

What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/flipper-one-fw-update/<dev>/target
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.5
Contact:	Alexey Charkov <alchark@flipper.net>
Description:	(RO) Name of the MCU firmware build target that matches this
		board revision, as used in the names of published MCU
		firmware images (for example "f1"). Userspace uses it to pick
		the image to upload; the driver cannot tell from an image
		which target it was built for.

		Absent on board revisions the driver does not know.

		Format: %s.
